<h1>current_minute</h1>
<p>This <b>read only</b> variable will return the minutes that correspond to the current moment.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Syntax:</h4>
<p class="code">current_minute;</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Returns:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-keyref="Type_Real"><a target="_blank" href="../../../GML_Overview/Data_Types.htm">Real</a></span></p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p class="code">draw_text(32, 32, &quot;The time is &quot; + string(current_hour) + &quot;:&quot; + string(current_minute) + &quot;.&quot; + string(current_second));</p>
<p>The above code would draw the current international time on the screen.</p>
<p> </p>
